# 📥 IMDb Dataset Download Instructions

The IMDb dataset is not included in this repository due to its large file size.

### Download the dataset

🔗 [Download IMDb 50K Movie Reviews from Kaggle](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/lakshmi25npathi/imdb-dataset-of-50k-movie-reviews)

### Setup
1. Download the dataset from Kaggle.
2. Extract the ZIP file.
3. Place `IMDB Dataset.csv` in the project directory.
4. Run the Jupyter Notebook.

### Dataset Information
- Total reviews: 50,000
- Positive reviews: 25,000
- Negative reviews: 25,000
- Columns: `review`, `sentiment`
